Revision history for Mojolicious-Plugin-Buffer

0.07
	The default last_modified now uses the newest mtime of the application
	script and the renderer's template files and directories.  Editing a
	template therefore changes Last-Modified and invalidates cache entries
	built before the edit, instead of leaving clients with a stale 304.

0.06
	Add cache_lock_dir, a flock-based shared lock backend, so single-flight
	coalesces cache misses across hypnotoad workers, not just within one.
	Run the suite with all recommended modules hidden by
	Test::Without::Module, and make optional-module detection ignore an
	ambient $SIG{__DIE__} handler that would otherwise defeat it.

0.05
	Generate Last-Modified by default from the application script's mtime.
	Honour If-Modified-Since when no ETag is generated, while If-None-Match
	still takes precedence.

0.04
	HTML::Packer is now optional: without it optimise_content still applies
	the white-space squashing and link rewriting.

0.03
	Add single-flight coalescing of concurrent cache misses, with the
	cache_single_flight and cache_lock_timeout options.

0.02
	Add the optional CHI-backed server-side cache and the buffer_is_cached
	helper.

0.001.0
	Initial version.
